# Consultation email (Railway blocks Gmail SMTP — use HTTPS webhook instead)
# 1) Paste scripts/consultation-mail.gs into https://script.google.com
# 2) Deploy → Web app → Execute as Me → Anyone
# 3) Set the Web App URL here / on Railway:
# CONSULTATION_WEBHOOK_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXX/exec
# GMAIL=digigrey.ai@gmail.com
# CONSULTATION_TO_EMAIL=digigrey.ai@gmail.com

# Optional Resend fallback
# RESEND_API_KEY=
